; eval_arena - THE HARNESS'S GROUND, not game content (tools/Eval.ps1).
;
; 28x24 and open, because that is what the suites were written against:
; arena.eval carves its shapes centred on 14,12 and hardcodes those
; coordinates, and smoke.eval stands at 12,8 and takes twenty seconds of
; whatever is nearby. An open room means every `tp` lands and every carve
; has room, so a test never fails for a reason belonging to the scenery.
;
; IT IS DELIBERATELY DULL. A hand-authored showcase level used to serve
; this purpose, which meant content could not be redecorated without
; breaking measurements. Harness levels are named eval_* and are the
; harness's own; more will join this one.
;
palette wall wall_temple_ancient wall_marble wall_brick_old wall_cobble_mossy
palette floor floor_temple floor_ancient_stone floor_slabs floor_cobble_mossy
palette ceiling ceiling_rock_layered ceiling_stone ceiling_cracked ceiling_rock_porous
atmosphere dust=0.05 haze=0.6 ambient=1.5
;
